From: David J. Vandenburgh <david@vandenburgh.co>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: raise the GPU devfreq upthreshold to 70

simple_ondemand jumps to the top frequency whenever the GPU is busier
than upthreshold, and only sizes the frequency to the load below it.
With the default of 50, a Retroid Pocket 6 (A740) running a 30 fps game
made 700 to 900 jumps to 680 MHz from each middle step and spent 29.4%
of the run at the top frequency while averaging 437 MHz.

Measured on that handheld over two runs of the same game:

  upthreshold           50        80
  GPU clock avg         437 MHz   256 MHz
  time at 680 MHz       29.4%     8.1%
  battery power avg     4673 mW   4194 mW
  hottest CPU zone max  80.0 C    70.5 C

The game held its frame rate at 80. Use 70, which keeps part of the
margin the original 50 was chosen for. debugfs still overrides it.

Signed-off-by: David J. Vandenburgh <david@vandenburgh.co>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gpu_devfreq.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gpu_devfreq.c
index 2e1d5c3..5a91d92 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gpu_devfreq.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gpu_devfreq.c
@@ -147,12 +147,17 @@ void msm_devfreq_init(struct msm_gpu *gpu)
 		return;
 
 	/*
-	 * Setup default values for simple_ondemand governor tuning.  We
-	 * want to throttle up at 50% load for the double-buffer case,
+	 * Setup default values for simple_ondemand governor tuning.
+	 * Mainline throttles up at 50% load for the double-buffer case,
 	 * where due to stalling waiting for vblank we could get stuck
-	 * at (for ex) 30fps at 50% utilization.
+	 * at (for ex) 30fps at 50% utilization. Past the threshold the
+	 * governor goes straight to the top frequency, and at 50 a
+	 * Retroid Pocket 6 spent 29% of a 30fps game there while
+	 * averaging 437 MHz of 680. At 80 it averaged 256 MHz, held its
+	 * frame rate and drew about 10% less from the battery, so 70
+	 * keeps some of mainline's margin. Still tunable in debugfs.
 	 */
-	priv->gpu_devfreq_config.upthreshold = 50;
+	priv->gpu_devfreq_config.upthreshold = 70;
 	priv->gpu_devfreq_config.downdifferential = 10;
 
 	mutex_init(&df->lock);
